# PM Review Policy v4 (Autonomous Mode)

## PM is NOT an approver

PM = Product Vision. Cursor = Roadmap execution. **PM response not required to continue.**

## Loop

```text
Epic → Production → 회고 → Next Epic → …
```

Not: Epic → PM review → Next Epic.

## Pipeline (no stop)

Develop → QA → Lighthouse → Commit → Push → Production → Tag → 회고 → Next Epic

## High-risk only (PM gate before Production)

DB · Billing · Real AI/LLM · Auth structure · Product Pivot · cost APIs

## Forbidden phrases (never output)

PASS/FAIL 부탁 · 검토/승인 부탁 · 진행/배포/커밋할까요 · Preview/Production 확인 부탁 · PM 판단 대기 · any closing question to PM

## Report ending (mandatory)

```text
Next Autonomous Target
Epic / 진행률 / 예상 완료 / 다음 보고 08:00
```

Not approval requests. Reports are records.

